Write a solution to find managers with at least five direct reports.
Return the result table in any order.


SOLUTION:

SELECT Employee.name
FROM Employee 
LEFT JOIN ( -- inner join also works, but left join could keep null values that may be of importance in further analysis
    SELECT managerId, 
    COUNT(managerId) AS count -- counting the occurence of each manager id
    FROM Employee 
    GROUP BY managerId) AS Occurence 
ON Employee.id = Occurence.managerId -- connecting the link between an employee being a manager
WHERE Occurence.count >= 5 -- checking they have the direct reports
